  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.0.0: migrate from NFS-Client to OpenNFS: fully asynchronous NFSv3 with cancellation and concurrency, true streaming reads and writes, truncation on overwrite, COMMIT for unstable writes, portmapper discovery, and automatic reconnect.  NFSv2 and NFSv4 are no longer accepted.  Targets net8.0 and net10.0 (netstandard2.1 dropped).",
